{"logId": "02d4456a-7c84-4b5a-b27b-8339b56c4428", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "header_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [839, 135, 1083, 253], "block_id": 0, "block_order": null, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[839.0, 135.0], [1083.0, 135.0], [1083.0, 253.0], [839.0, 253.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "肤浅的。我给“胖东来”的成功归纳出几个原因：一是以人为本，善待员工，员工们至上司很有“亲和力”；二是真诚对待消费者，无论在卖场哪个角落，都能听到对顾客亲热的打招呼声；三是诚信经营，真正做到了“用真品，换真心，不满意，就退货”，如此这般，消费者购物当然首选“胖东来”了。返回郑州前，我又去“胖东来”一逛，临别还专门在顾客留言簿上写下了由衷之言，在盛赞的同时，也建议“胖东来”每个收银台都设“刷卡器”，“胖东来”的小姑娘真诚地对我说：“姐，谢谢您！”", "block_bbox": [198, 228, 978, 431], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 228.0], [978.0, 228.0], [978.0, 431.0], [198.0, 431.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "晨会", "block_bbox": [229, 496, 431, 552], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[229.0, 496.0], [431.0, 496.0], [431.0, 552.0], [229.0, 552.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "作者：服饰部/师小华", "block_bbox": [259, 562, 428, 585], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[259.0, 562.0], [428.0, 562.0], [428.0, 585.0], [259.0, 585.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "卖场调整货架需要早班的人加班帮忙，忙活了一阵子后，能看见的人只有几个了。于是主管路路便问剩下的几个人：“她们都去哪了？”“偷偷走了吧？”几乎是异口同声的说。路路的脸色沉了下来，但没有发火。过了一会儿，不见的人陆陆续续的抬着该整理的物品下来了，“还想着你们是半道开溜了呢。”路路的脸上笑容绽放。", "block_bbox": [198, 615, 977, 747], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 615.0], [977.0, 615.0], [977.0, 747.0], [198.0, 747.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "在第二天的晨会上路路姐当着大家面道歉，说这几天卖场调整，大家辛苦了，她不该误认为大家偷偷的走了，心里很生气。当她看到大家抬着物品下来的时候，心里暖暖的，真想大声说：我爱你们！她很后悔自己的举动，她不该误会大家，因为我们是一个团队，是一个“有活大家一起干，有快乐一起分享，团结一心相帮相鞠了一躬。\n这也许是我们最感动的一次晨会\n了。领导能与员工坦诚相待，即\n使有误会，也会消除的。因为\n我们是胖东来人，我们有自\n己的信仰与追求那就是，公\n平、自由、快乐、博爱。", "block_bbox": [199, 755, 975, 897], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[199.0, 755.0], [975.0, 755.0], [975.0, 897.0], [199.0, 897.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [200, 930, 295, 955], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[200.0, 930.0], [294.0, 930.0], [294.0, 954.0], [200.0, 954.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [198, 963, 546, 1166], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 963.0], [546.0, 963.0], [546.0, 1166.0], [198.0, 1166.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [1000, 608, 1138, 725], "block_id": 8, "block_order": null, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[1000.0, 608.0], [1138.0, 608.0], [1138.0, 725.0], [1000.0, 725.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [537, 907, 1033, 1234], "block_id": 9, "block_order": null, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[537.0, 907.0], [1033.0, 907.0], [1033.0, 1234.0], [537.0, 1234.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "妻的感动", "block_bbox": [111, 1407, 260, 1448], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[111.0, 1407.0], [260.0, 1407.0], [260.0, 1448.0], [111.0, 1448.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 13, "label": "header_image", "score": 0.770776093006134, "coordinate": [839, 135, 1083, 253], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[839.0, 135.0], [1083.0, 135.0], [1083.0, 253.0], [839.0, 253.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9340441226959229, "coordinate": [198, 228, 978, 431], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 228.0], [978.0, 228.0], [978.0, 431.0], [198.0, 431.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8255012035369873, "coordinate": [229, 496, 431, 552], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[229.0, 496.0], [431.0, 496.0], [431.0, 552.0], [229.0, 552.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.754352867603302, "coordinate": [259, 562, 428, 585], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[259.0, 562.0], [428.0, 562.0], [428.0, 585.0], [259.0, 585.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9453867673873901, "coordinate": [198, 615, 977, 747], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 615.0], [977.0, 615.0], [977.0, 747.0], [198.0, 747.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7640069723129272, "coordinate": [199, 755, 975, 897], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[199.0, 755.0], [975.0, 755.0], [975.0, 897.0], [199.0, 897.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.7023945450782776, "coordinate": [1000, 608, 1138, 725], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[1000.0, 608.0], [1138.0, 608.0], [1138.0, 725.0], [1000.0, 725.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.35542383790016174, "coordinate": [200, 930, 295, 955], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[200.0, 930.0], [294.0, 930.0], [294.0, 954.0], [200.0, 954.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9114336371421814, "coordinate": [198, 963, 546, 1166], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 963.0], [546.0, 963.0], [546.0, 1166.0], [198.0, 1166.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9272143244743347, "coordinate": [537, 907, 1033, 1234], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[537.0, 907.0], [1033.0, 907.0], [1033.0, 1234.0], [537.0, 1234.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7976575493812561, "coordinate": [111, 1407, 260, 1448], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[111.0, 1407.0], [260.0, 1407.0], [260.0, 1448.0], [111.0, 1448.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "肤浅的。我给“胖东来”的成功归纳出几个原因：一是以人为本，善待员工，员工们至上司很有“亲和力”；二是真诚对待消费者，无论在卖场哪个角落，都能听到对顾客亲热的打招呼声；三是诚信经营，真正做到了“用真品，换真心，不满意，就退货”，如此这般，消费者购物当然首选“胖东来”了。返回郑州前，我又去“胖东来”一逛，临别还专门在顾客留言簿上写下了由衷之言，在盛赞的同时，也建议“胖东来”每个收银台都设“刷卡器”，“胖东来”的小姑娘真诚地对我说：“姐，谢谢您！”\n\n## 晨会\n\n作者：服饰部/师小华\n\n卖场调整货架需要早班的人加班帮忙，忙活了一阵子后，能看见的人只有几个了。于是主管路路便问剩下的几个人：“她们都去哪了？”“偷偷走了吧？”几乎是异口同声的说。路路的脸色沉了下来，但没有发火。过了一会儿，不见的人陆陆续续的抬着该整理的物品下来了，“还想着你们是半道开溜了呢。”路路的脸上笑容绽放。\n\n在第二天的晨会上路路姐当着大家面道歉，说这几天卖场调整，大家辛苦了，她不该误认为大家偷偷的走了，心里很生气。当她看到大家抬着物品下来的时候，心里暖暖的，真想大声说：我爱你们！她很后悔自己的举动，她不该误会大家，因为我们是一个团队，是一个“有活大家一起干，有快乐一起分享，团结一心相帮相鞠了一躬。\n\n这也许是我们最感动的一次晨会\n\n了。领导能与员工坦诚相待，即\n\n使有误会，也会消除的。因为\n\n我们是胖东来人，我们有自\n\n己的信仰与追求那就是，公\n\n平、自由、快乐、博爱。\n\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1000_608_1138_725.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"11%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_537_907_1033_1234.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"41%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 妻的感动", "images": {"imgs/img_in_header_image_box_839_135_1083_253.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//02d4456a-7c84-4b5a-b27b-8339b56c4428/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_header_image_box_839_135_1083_253.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A57%3A35Z%2F-1%2F%2F2406d77c13cdd97ae334543614d1e9663a633cc5a5f5ee4ed8b0274415b1a0a1", "imgs/img_in_image_box_1000_608_1138_725.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//02d4456a-7c84-4b5a-b27b-8339b56c4428/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_1000_608_1138_725.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A57%3A36Z%2F-1%2F%2F2cffef6e23fc40122519b800bc54863936a62e8182d4982f5bf916ad13c867b7", "imgs/img_in_image_box_537_907_1033_1234.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//02d4456a-7c84-4b5a-b27b-8339b56c4428/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_537_907_1033_1234.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A57%3A36Z%2F-1%2F%2Fd732abfb1326d27903c3e7252db5f6